{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Set the PS3 to 192.168.0.3\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Set the gateway on both PC and PS3 to 192.168.0.1\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Set the subnet mask the same for both to 255.255.255.0\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Set the DNS on both to be 8.8.8.8\par
